  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Added the AnsiConsoleFactory with Stderr() and Quiet() helpers for creating an IAnsiConsole that avoids writing to stdout, for use behind a stdio-based protocol such as MCP where stdout must stay reserved for the protocol stream\n      - Added RunMcpSafe extension method on BaseSimpleExecRunner<TSelf> as a discoverable, console-safe wrapper around ReadAsync for use when running behind an MCP host\n      - Annotated BaseSimpleExecRunnerExtensions with [PublicAPI] (JetBrains.Annotations) so IDE inspections don't flag its public extension methods as unused",
